msgstr "⟪k:0⟫雅各布表面上沉默不语，⟪k:1⟫心中大概是这么想的吧。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9284FAB1_ED7F_4207_9568_67323E6E71E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75905348c50fca3e9af4acef21236cbc826537e558da4e9839bff566814d6ff1
