msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8DD80C3F_E54A_4564_A327_1DCA58573F8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But government bonds alone were not enough to finance the massive undertaking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫除了来自国家的资助金，⟪k:1⟫这个庞大项目需要更多的资金流转。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0137D38_9C52_46BA_8625_C65F5979D6A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e36e68d87fe1d8f78ac0b154a9f99220d0038a87da4b33657de3f7b973fdd031
